    "Copy all files from cases/ytmusic_search_no_debounce/testcase/ into perf_testing/hapray/testcases/com.example.myapplication/.",
    "Install each clean signed variant and run the PerfLoad_ytmusic_0030 HapRay testcase for >= 3 rounds.",
    "Verify the real UI path and compare the declared CPU/memory metric; build/smoke success alone is not a performance verdict."
  ],
